# The six kernels beside this file are nluca's step and pre-activation
# kernels as CubeCL 0.6 emits them for wgpu (Metal), copied one a file from
# noctiluca-dev/results/nluca/step_kernels_emitted.wgsl (its header maps every
# binding). This is their dispatch contract (noctiluca-dev rust/nluca/src/gpu.rs):
# one thread a row, a 1-D dispatch of 256-wide workgroups over a band of rows.
# The width (ints[0]) and the band's first row (offset[0]) are at most 2^20;
# ints and offset are buffer_5/buffer_6 in the tabled kernels and
# buffer_4/buffer_5 in the wireless and windowed ones.
workgroups x 1 4096
workgroups y 1 1
workgroups z 1 1
param buffer_4_global[0] 0 1048576
param buffer_5_global[0] 0 1048576
param buffer_6_global[0] 0 1048576
